# Claude Harness — "strong eyes, cheap hands" dispatch runner.
# Only the OLLAMA hand family needs a token: a claude-family hand is an ordinary subagent on your
# own session's auth, dispatched with the Agent tool — nothing to configure.
# Copy this file to .dev.vars (gitignored) and set the token below.
# NEVER commit the real value — .dev.vars must stay out of git.
#
# Preferred setup is `export OLLAMA_HAND_TOKEN=…` in your shell rc: env reads survive the
# command-sandbox, which denies reading .dev.vars. This file is the fallback for environments
# without the sandbox (and the source generate-ci derives the CI secret names from).
ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN=
